<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00202/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一件印有蜘蛛侠头像的衬衫，在被人穿戴时穿戴者说出的人名均会被替换为蜘蛛侠，穿戴者在被他人提醒之前不会察觉到自身的异常。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>广西壮族自治区██市██区一服装店内，同一批次物品无异常性质。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>储存于Site-CN-██低价值物品收容区内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>请蜘蛛侠同志听到广播后马上到蜘蛛侠主管办公室一趟，重复一遍，请蜘蛛侠&#8230;&#8230;——受异常影响时正在使用广播的Site-CN-██站点主管</em><br />
<em>当我来到主管的办公室时，等得不耐烦的主管连广播都没关就把我骂了一顿，于是整个站点的人都听着主管骂了十分钟的蜘蛛侠，这件事弄得最近几天主管他都把自己关在办公室里。——研究员O████</em></p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00202" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00202" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00202-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wdxagj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6369458); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6369458&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="wdxaGJ" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6369458)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wdxagj" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6369458); return false;">wdxaGJ</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1589586459 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">15 May 2020 23:47</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00116/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一只日式漆器食盒，表面刻有樱花图样，在项目底部发现刻有古日语<em>晴明寮</em>的注文字样，内有 <span style="text-decoration: line-through;">12</span> 9枚樱花饼。项目的异常性质具有精神影响，且只有在开启项目，并食用盒中樱花饼后才能激活。<br />
当项目异常性质激活时，受试者将会认为自己坐在一棵日本晚樱树（Oriental Cherry）下欣赏樱花，异常影响将会在受试者吃完手中樱饼后停止；额外放入项目中的樱花饼在食用时不会触发上述现象。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020<em>██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>中国香港特别行政区，Sothebuy's拍卖场，由Dr.Okazaki买下<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>收容于site-cn-██低价值保险柜中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong> 此间遍开者,樱花烂漫胜仙境,不似人间景。</em> ——受到异常影响，盘坐于site-cn-██员工休息室地板上的Dr.Okazaki<br />
<em>Dr……Dr.Okazaki？</em>——Dr.Yang</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00116" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00116" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00116-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ps-yumemi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5005512); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5005512&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="Ps Yumemi" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5005512)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ps-yumemi" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(5005512); return false;">Ps Yumemi</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587895587 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Apr 2020 10:06</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00362/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<strong>项目描述：</strong>一个箱子，在面对猫科动物时似乎拥有无限内存，并持续吸引目击项目的猫科动物跳入其中。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██市██宠物店<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">保存在SITE-CN-81低价值物品保存柜中。</span>已损坏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">访问监控录像20██/██/██，██：██：██</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">权限接受</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Dr.Drew:这个箱子肯定没被清理过，那如果我把那根驱逐猫的黄瓜扔进去会怎么样呢？<br />
[数据损坏]</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<br />
<strong>附录：</strong>20██/██/██，Dr.Drew将一根00361丢入00362中，在不到一秒间超过█████只不同品种的猫喷涌而出，造成经济损失超过█████元，超过██个异常项目被毁，Dr.Drew侥幸不死，一切损失将由Dr.Drew承担。
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00362" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00362" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00362-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1597578736 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">16 Aug 2020 11:52</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一张████餐馆的菜单，任何人类在观察项目时，项目上的菜品都会变成此人最喜欢吃的东西，当有人在菜品后的方框中打勾时，此人的面前就会出现刚刚勾选的菜品<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>上海市████餐馆中<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>放置于site—██的食堂中<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>嘿，终于不用忍受食堂那可怕的饭菜了！</em>——Dr.pigeon</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+实验记录</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;实验记录1</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>当使用机器人在菜单上勾选时，会在空中出现一行字：“机器人不用吃饭”语言随观察者而变化</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00111" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00111" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00111-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6306406&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="ScorpionidaSlaughter" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6306406)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/scorpionidaslaughter" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6306406); return false;">ScorpionidaSlaughter</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587805117 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">25 Apr 2020 08:58</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00076/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一把由基金会后勤武装部门提供的M16 A2，配有圆桩型护木；当使用项目对人类进行射击时，在射击对象前方1m处将会出现一个与其体型一致的医疗人体模型，并且会用双手捂住受射击的位置，但射击后的子弹会消失。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/04/17<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>Site-CN-75射击训练场。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被收容于低危异常物品收容柜内。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>与其一同被制造出来的设备并无发现异常性质，且生产工艺及流水线设备亦无发现异常。</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00076" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00076" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00076-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3167340&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="Yoghurt-rescuer" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3167340)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yoghurt-rescuer" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3167340); return false;">Yoghurt-rescuer</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1587133100 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">17 Apr 2020 14:18</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00502/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一副AKG N50██耳机，在蓝牙模式开启后会随机选择一台半径10米之内的具有音频输出功能的电子设备（如手机，电脑等）并同步播放该设备上正在播放的音频<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/12/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>由研究员Kimura L购买自京█，已确认同批次其它产品无异常性质<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>存放于Site-CN-19的低价值异常物品存放点，将其列装MTF-█████-█作为监听设备的请求待批准<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong> &quot;我明明把所有隐身窗口都关掉了&#8230;&#8230;&quot; &#8212;研究员Kimura L</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00502" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00502" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00502-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chengdu-hunters" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4982782); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4982782&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="Chengdu Hunters" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4982782)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chengdu-hunters" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(4982782); return false;">Chengdu Hunters</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1609251670 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">29 Dec 2020 14:21</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00410/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong><span style="text-decoration: line-through;">800</span>795枚材质未知且十分坚硬的硬币，在遭到弹击时将会受到超过█████████%的加速度飞射出去，这导致其被赋予了极大的动能。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>██超市██仓库<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>尝试复制以供给MTF用作杀手锏<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>你指尖跃动的电光，是我此生不变的信仰，唯我超电磁炮永世长存！——Dr.阙</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00410" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00410" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00410-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6441401&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1609855058" alt="zeta-9-beta" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6441401)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zeta-9-beta" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6441401); return false;">zeta-9-beta</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1601084778 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">26 Sep 2020 01:46</span></p>
